  "body": "40A Waiake Street - SOLD & SETTLED\r\n40C Waiake Street - SOLD\r\n\r\n40B Waiake Street is the LAST one available!\r\n\r\nPlease note: The interior photos shown are of 40C Waiake Street and are provided for illustrative purposes only. 40B has the same floor plan and layout!\r\n\r\nJust 550 metres from Waiake Beach, this beautifully presented G.J. Gardner-built home delivers space, privacy and effortless family living in a premium coastal location.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned at the rear behind secure electric gates, the property offers a safe, child- and pet-friendly setting, with generous proportions and easy-care living across two levels.\r\n\r\n*Property documents: Copy and paste the link below into your browser, then scroll down:\r\nhttps://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35095\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area flows seamlessly to a sunny paved terrace and generous backyard-ideal for entertaining, relaxing and family play. A separate lounge provides valuable additional living space, complemented by a guest powder room, excellent storage, a double internal-access garage and flexible off-street parking.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find four generous bedrooms, including two with private ensuites, plus a separate family bathroom, an additional separate toilet and a convenient study nook-completing this highly functional floor plan.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n- Quality construction by G.J. Gardner Homes\r\n- 235sqm (approx.) home | 424sqm (approx.) freehold land\r\n- Four generous bedrooms, including two with private ensuites\r\n- Three well-appointed bathrooms, plus a separate toilet\r\n- Two spacious living areas, plus a convenient upstairs STUDY NOOK\r\n- Double internal-access garage, plus flexible off-street parking\r\n- Sunny private patio and generous backyard\r\n- Ventilation system and underfloor heating in the bathrooms\r\n- Privately positioned behind secure electric gates\r\n\r\nMoments from Waiake Beach, Torbay Sailing Club and Torbay Village, with Browns Bay and Long Bay Regional Park also within easy reach, this is coastal living at its best.\r\n\r\nZoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College, the property is an outstanding choice for families seeking quality education alongside an exceptional beachside lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendor is committed to achieving a sale-now is the time to make your move. Visit one of our open homes and experience this exceptional coastal property for yourself.",
